<article class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">How to Download YouTube Videos Safely</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Published on <%= currentYear %>-07-31 · <%= siteTitle %> Guides</p>

    <%- include('../partials/ad-unit', { adSlot: 'blog-youtube-top' }) %>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Downloading YouTube videos can be useful for saving content you created, public domain media, or videos where the creator has given explicit permission. This guide explains how to use <%= siteTitle %> safely and responsibly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">1. Copy the Video URL</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Open YouTube in your browser or mobile app, find the video, and copy the link. On desktop, copy the address from the browser bar. On mobile, tap the <strong>Share</strong> button and choose <strong>Copy link</strong>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">2. Paste the URL into <%= siteTitle %></h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Visit our <a href="/" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">home page</a>, paste the link in the input box, and click <strong>Get Video</strong>. Our server fetches the available formats for that video.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">3. Choose the Right Format</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">You will see a list of all available formats. Common options include:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>MP4 (H.264):</strong> Best compatibility with phones, tablets, TVs, and editing software.</li>
        <li><strong>WEBM (VP9 / AV1):</strong> Smaller file sizes at high quality; works well in modern browsers.</li>
        <li><strong>Audio only (M4A / WEBM):</strong> Great for podcasts, music, or saving data.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mt-4">If you are unsure, choose <strong>Best available</strong> and we will pick the highest quality option.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">4. Respect Copyright</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Only download videos you own, public domain works, or content explicitly allowed by the rights holder. YouTube’s Terms of Service generally do not permit downloading except through YouTube’s own features or with permission. See our <a href="/disclaimer" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Disclaimer</a> for more details.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">5. Troubleshoot Blocks</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">YouTube sometimes blocks server IP addresses with “Sign in to confirm you’re not a bot.” If this happens, open the <strong>Advanced options</strong> section on the home page and supply a valid PO token, visitor data, or cookies file. This is optional but may help on heavily restricted networks.</p>
    </div>

    <%- include('../partials/ad-unit', { adSlot: 'blog-youtube-bottom' }) %>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/blog" class="btn-primary">Back to all guides</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
